mt6885 display / Xiaomi J10 panel: screen features (2026-10-23)

- panel power-on: 120 ms after the OFC block instead of the BSP's 80 ms
  (lit-but-black ~1 in 10 at 120 Hz), no second 0x60 after the init, DSI
  clock lane HS and EXT_TE_EN only after the panel init, BSP reset order
- panel sysfs: hbm (sunlight / FOD), dc_dimming (CCORR output gain,
  mtk_drm_set_output_gain), idle_ms (idle refresh 120 -> 60 Hz via
  mtk_dsi_set_idle_cb), color_mode (p3, p3-d65, srgb, native), doze (AOD),
  debug status / dcs
- see mainline/display/PLAN.md
